0023: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0024:     """
0025:     Replace each separated 3x3 tile by its background-cell complement, colored red.
0026: 
0027:     Input structure:
0028:     - The background is the dominant empty color.
0029:     - One foreground color occupies cells inside 3x3 tile regions.
0030:     - Tile regions are separated from each other by full-background rows and columns.
0031: 
0032:     Rule:
0033:     - Keep the same grid shape and the same separator/background cells.
0034:     - Inside each 3x3 tile, erase every foreground pixel.
0035:     - Paint each originally background pixel inside the tile red.
0036: 
0037:     Key insight:
